add('history','保留的棋盘历史（每个箭头 = 一次移动）','Retained board history (each arrow = one move)')
add('s1e','这一步要回答：为什么不能随便尝试，碰到目标就结束？把一个完整棋盘叫作一个状态，把一次合法移动叫作两个状态间的一条边。123405 是按行连接两行的写法，即 [[1,2,3],[4,0,5]]；每一位仍代表固定格子，不是数字大小。','Why not try arbitrary moves and stop at a goal? A state is one complete board; an edge connects two states one legal move apart. The row-by-row string 123405 means [[1,2,3],[4,0,5]]. Each character occupies a fixed square; the string is not a numeric magnitude.')
add('wrong','反例：从 123405 把 0 与 5 交换会到 123450；接着再交换又回到 123405。盲目递归会无限兜圈。随意尝试找到的路径也未必最短：先经 103425 → 013425 再折返至起点然后到目标，共 5 步，而直接交换只需 1 步。不能把“找到一条路”当成“证明最短”。','Counterexample: swapping 0 with 5 takes 123405 to 123450, and swapping back returns to 123405. Blind recursion can loop forever. Arbitrary first-found routes need not be shortest: go via 103425 → 013425, retrace to the start, then reach the goal: 5 moves instead of 1. Finding a route alone does not prove it is shortest.')
add('baseline','一个正确但重复工作的基线：列出全部 6! = 720 个状态，将起点距离设为 0，其余设为无穷大。反复扫描每条边 u→v，用 d[v] = min(d[v], d[u]+1) 松弛（即改善已知步数），直到一整轮没有变化。最短路不必重复状态，因此最多 719 轮就足够。每轮重扫已稳定的距离很浪费；下面改成只处理新找到的一层。','A correct baseline with repeated work: list all 6! = 720 states, set the start distance to 0 and all others to infinity. Repeatedly scan every edge u→v and relax it (improve its known distance) with d[v] = min(d[v], d[u]+1), until a full pass changes nothing. A shortest path never needs a repeated state, so 719 passes suffice. Rescanning settled distances wastes work; next we process only each newly discovered layer.')
add('baselineCode','正确基线的核心（完整可运行版本在本地测试中）','Correct baseline core (complete executable version in local tests)')
add('baselineCost','若 V 为状态数、E 为合法边数，此基线最坏 O(VE) 时间、O(V+E) 空间（存图）。每个状态至多有 3 个相邻状态。我们不需要为每个状态预存所有路径。','With V states and E legal edges, this baseline costs O(VE) time and O(V+E) space when storing the graph. Each state has at most 3 neighbors. We never need to retain every possible route.')
add('s2e','这一步要回答：怎样知道第一次遇到目标就是最少步数？广度优先搜索（BFS）按步数一层层找。前沿是“刚发现、距离同为 d 步”的所有状态；seen 是已经发现的状态集合。起点在第 0 层，因为尚未移动。','How can the first encounter with the goal prove the fewest moves? Breadth-first search (BFS) explores one move count at a time. The frontier contains every newly discovered state at distance d; seen is the set of all discovered states. The start is layer 0 because no move has been made.')
add('derive','仍看 123405：0 在位置 4（从 0 开始按行编号），只能换位置 1、3、5，于是得到 103425、123045、123450。这三块棋盘都是 1 步可达。123450 已是目标，且第 0 层不是目标，所以答案是 1。下一次从 103425 生成 123405 时，seen 会拒绝它：它早在第 0 层就出现过，绕回去不会让路更短。','Keep 123405: 0 occupies position 4 (zero-based, row-major), so it can swap only with positions 1, 3, 5. This gives 103425, 123045, 123450, each reachable in 1 move. The last is the goal and layer 0 was not, so the answer is 1. Later, when 103425 generates 123405, seen rejects it: that board was already found at layer 0, and returning cannot improve its distance.')
add('invariant','由此得到不变量：进入第 d 层时，前沿恰好包含最短距离为 d 的状态，seen 恰好包含距离不超过 d 的状态。扩展前沿的一条边只会得到距离至多 d+1 的状态；未见过的状态不可能距离 ≤d，否则早已发现。因此新状态的距离恰为 d+1，发现时立即加入 seen，防止同层重复。任何 d+1 步的路径，其倒数第二个状态距离至多 d，所以新一层也不会漏掉状态。所有边都代表 1 次移动，此证明才成立。','This yields the invariant: on entering layer d, the frontier is exactly the states whose shortest distance is d, and seen is exactly those within distance d. One edge from the frontier reaches a state within d+1 moves. An unseen state cannot be within d moves, or it would already have been discovered. Its distance is therefore exactly d+1. Mark it seen immediately to avoid duplicates within the new layer. Every (d+1)-move path has a penultimate state within d moves, so the next layer misses no state either. This proof relies on every edge costing one move.')
add('traceTask','先用“一步到达”走到末尾，再选“五步到达”，逐层前进，查看保留的层记录。每帧显示进入该层时的全部前沿；候选账本展示上一层第一个状态的扩展，其余状态也已完整扩展。切换预设会重启此搜索。','Finish “One move”, then select “Five moves”. Advance layer by layer and inspect the retained layer ledger. Each frame shows the full frontier on entering that layer. The candidate ledger details the previous layer’s first state; all other states were also fully expanded. Changing the preset restarts this search.')
add('sim','教学模拟：JavaScript 按完整层生成快照，并非执行下面的 Python。Python 用队列逐个取出状态，可能在一层中途返回；最少步数相同。未截断任何层或前沿。','Teaching simulation: JavaScript creates complete-layer snapshots; it does not execute the Python below. Python removes states individually from a queue and may return partway through a layer; the minimum move count is the same. No layer or frontier is truncated.')
add('presetLabel','搜索预设（更换即重启）','Search preset (changing restarts)')
